  "question": {
    "text": "If the area bounded by <math><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;sq. units, then <math><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
