  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/fufufufu123123.JPG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 236px; height: 148px;\" /><br />The required area is <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p><p><math><mo>∴</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
